te_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k4qv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e729be8-e877-4dc2-bc06-2b0136c8d7c4","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"正確には人体とその飛沫物","ts":"1630257881.137800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7W/U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d8ba4f1-f313-4d0f-8b68-32c45d2252cf","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"そして今回のCOVID-19の場合、このウイルス自体にとっての汚染酸素は実質人体そのものといえる","ts":"1630257842.137400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XE0B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e0004ff-1cd3-4ff5-8e89-3e61d1d4b35a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"汚染酸素をいかにしてなくすかという課題になる","ts":"1630257798.136400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ea9AC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76ec7045-8106-44a5-b461-d91dfbce4c1c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"100マスの酸素の中に1マスの汚染酸素があるだけでも、その1マスのせいでそこそこの量が安定して存在してしまう","ts":"1630257788.135900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vyYn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"502b1b79-6973-4b6e-a701-2a3851350d85","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ただし例外的にヘドロという物体と汚染酸素という気体の中のみで、すさまじい勢いで増加する","ts":"1630257756.135000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9h2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb6c8766-4ac3-4386-98df-588579eb11f2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"腐肺菌は任意の気体・物質中に存在できるんだけど、基本的にはすごい勢いで半減していって、最終的に完全に0になる","ts":"1630257740.134600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5so"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf95f3f7-b8b0-44d9-b4ff-45bb4fc3b878","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"Oxygen Not Includedやってると、腐肺病という菌由来の病気があります。腐肺菌という菌があって、これを吸い込むと腐肺病に感染するんですが、これはかなり面白い性質があって、菌自体は基本的にはほっとけば勝手に死んでそのうち消えるんですよ。","ts":"1630257696.133300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gqri"}]}]
